7. Summary
The Conductor MCP is the central nerve center of our automation platform, responsible for:

Receiving and analyzing incoming tasks.

Dynamically routing emails to the Email MCP based on risk and intent.

Coordinating human oversight through the dashboard for high-risk cases.

Maintaining comprehensive logs and feedback to enable continuous improvement.

Even at this early stage—focused on email processing—its centralized decision-making and robust logging provide critical benefits in reliability, scalability, and future expansion. This ensures that our system remains efficient and adaptable as we integrate additional functionalities over time.